                <div class="event-details-content-box">
                    <p>The “Golden Business Forum” (GBF) was established in 2019 as an annual high-level business platform and channel for business development in Africa and beyond. The aim of GBF is to serve as a catalyst for business development in Africa, between Africa and the world.</p>
                    <p>All activities associated with GBF are focused on bringing sustainable and innovative solutions to ongoing structural and long-term economic challenges that impede the growth of the African continent. GBF was honoured to be launched by His Excellency, the President of the Republic of Rwanda, who graciously accepted to be its patron moving forward.</p><hr>
                    <p style="text-align: left; background-color: black; padding: 8px; border-radius: 3px; color: #FFF;">GBF UPCOMING EVENT: <strong>13/08/2025</strong></p>

                    <h4>Objectives of the GBF</h4><hr>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled list-style-two">
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>Creating a platform and providing a voice for business operators and investors to engage in structured and responsive dialogue with senior business executives, policy makers, and other stakeholders.</h5>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
                            <h5>Identifying and facilitating business opportunities across Africa and promoting engagement between developers, investors, and financiers.</h5>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i>
